# Phase 5 lifecycle: OSC 7501 around a manual /compact. Nothing to compact
# first (no_op: no report), then a real compaction (working, then done).
env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-lifecycle-compactok-turns.json
work compact-ws
wait 4
type /compact
key Enter
wait 2
# "No context to compact." stays 1.5 s (compaction.rs TRANSIENT,
# compaction_activity.zig:123@481104fd): the wire and the snap below are
# taken once it has gone, by the screen (FLAKE-HINT4).
until gone No context to compact.
wire w00-noop
snap c00-noop
type first question
key Enter
wait 3
type second question
key Enter
wait 2.5
wire w01-answered
type /compact
key Enter
wait 0.6
wire w02-compacting
snap c02-compacting
wait 3.5
wire w03-compacted
snap c03-compacted
